{"words": [{"text": "وَوَهَبْنَا", "translation": "And We bestowed"}, {"text": "لَهُۥٓ", "translation": "to him"}, {"text": "إِسْحَـٰقَ", "translation": "Isaac"}, {"text": "وَيَعْقُوبَ ۚ", "translation": "and Yaqub"}, {"text": "كُلًّا", "translation": "all"}, {"text": "هَدَيْنَا ۚ", "translation": "We guided"}, {"text": "وَنُوحًا", "translation": "And Nuh"}, {"text": "هَدَيْنَا", "translation": "We guided"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلُ ۖ", "translation": "before"}, {"text": "وَمِن", "translation": "and of"}, {"text": "ذُرِّيَّتِهِۦ", "translation": "his descendents"}, {"text": "دَاوُۥدَ", "translation": "Dawood"}, {"text": "وَسُلَيْمَـٰنَ", "translation": "and Sulaiman"}, {"text": "وَأَيُّوبَ", "translation": "and Ayyub"}, {"text": "وَيُوسُفَ", "translation": "and Yusuf"}, {"text": "وَمُوسَىٰ", "translation": "and Musa"}, {"text": "وَهَـٰرُونَ ۚ", "translation": "and Harun"}, {"text": "وَكَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "And thus"}, {"text": "نَجْزِى", "translation": "We reward"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ", "translation": "the good-doers"}], "sahih": "And We gave to him [i.e., Abraham] Isaac and Jacob - all [of them] We guided. And Noah, We guided before; and among his descendants, David and Solomon and Job and Joseph and Moses and Aaron. Thus do We reward the doers of good."}